START GROUP DEFINITION
ELEMENT
_MAT_600 1 TO 85
_ROOF_900 86 TO 159
_WALL_EXT_600 160 TO 291
_WALL_INT_200 292 TO 306
_WALL_W6_W7_400 307 TO 336
END GROUP DEFINITION
DEFINE MATERIAL START
ISOTROPIC M35
E 2.95804e+07
POISSON 0.2
DENSITY 25
ALPHA 1e-05
DAMP 0.05
G 1.23252e+07
TYPE CONCRETE
STRENGTH FCU 35000
END DEFINE MATERIAL
ELEMENT PROPERTY
1 TO 85 THICKNESS 0.6
86 TO 159 THICKNESS 0.9
160 TO 291 THICKNESS 0.6
292 TO 306 THICKNESS 0.2
307 TO 336 THICKNESS 0.4
CONSTANTS
MATERIAL M35 ALL
*
* =====================================================================
*  ELASTIC MAT: STAAD works out each joint's tributary area from the mat
*  mesh automatically (18 x 6 grid, 108 mat joints,
*  mat area = 119.84 m2) and multiplies by
*  ks = 100000 kN/m3 [ASSUMED - Deccan basalt, pending site investigation],
*  exactly as in the reference model.
*  KFY on the 4 corner joints below is restated (FIXED BUT replaces the
*  ELASTIC MAT entry there) and is recomputed for THIS mesh's corner
*  tributary area: KFY = ks x 0.25 x (edge dx) x (edge dz).
* =====================================================================
SUPPORTS
1 TO 108 ELASTIC MAT DIRECT Y SUBGRADE 100000
* KFY restated on the four corner joints: without it they would lose ALL vertical
* restraint, because the FIXED BUT line replaces the ELASTIC MAT entry.
* KFY = ks x A_trib, A_trib from this model's own mesh:
1 FIXED BUT FY MX MY MZ KFY 27563
6 FIXED BUT FY MX MY MZ KFY 16538
103 FIXED BUT FY MX MY MZ KFY 28875
108 FIXED BUT FY MX MY MZ KFY 17325
*
* =====================================================================
*  LOADING - IDENTICAL in definition/magnitude to the reference model.
*  Every pressure is in kN/m2, global axes.  PRESSURE GX/GY/GZ acts along
*  the GLOBAL axis, so it does not depend on the plate local-axis direction.
* =====================================================================
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DL1 SELF WEIGHT
SELFWEIGHT Y -1
LOAD 2 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DL2 EARTH COVER ON ROOF 40.65 KN/M2
ELEMENT LOAD
86 TO 159 PR GY -40.65
LOAD 3 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DL3 SIDL SERVICES AND FINISHES
ELEMENT LOAD
86 TO 159 PR GY -2
1 TO 85 PR GY -1
LOAD 4 LOADTYPE Live  TITLE LL1 LIVE LOAD ON INTERNAL FLOOR 5.0 KN/M2
ELEMENT LOAD
1 TO 85 PR GY -5
LOAD 5 LOADTYPE Dead  TITLE DL4 STAIRCASE ON THE TWO SHAFT WALLS
ELEMENT LOAD
307 TO 321 PR GY -2.947
322 TO 336 PR GY -2.947
LOAD 6 LOADTYPE Soil  TITLE EP1 EARTH + WATER ON EXTERNAL WALLS
ELEMENT LOAD
